  "slug": "adaptive-design-curves-8294",
  "summary": "Expanding single-molecule and single-cell chromatin profiling demands validated, reproducible analysis workflows for accessibility and footprinting data.",
  "synthesis": "The dominant thread is explicit, reproducible processing of chromatin accessibility and footprinting data. PIPPA addresses QC and peak set curation for large-scale ATAC-seq and reports that peak calling performance is dataset-dependent, which motivates greater stringency in epidemiological studies. FiberBrowser and FiberHMM convert diverse single-molecule footprinting datasets into per-molecule chromatin states within one framework, while ChAI-Net learns a sequence-based regulatory code for locus-specific co-accessibility from single-molecule footprinting data. The barley study compares SNP-replacement and PHG composite draft genomes for MOA-seq TF footprint analysis across cultivars, and OSCAR provides paired single-cell ATAC and RNA profiles. What is new is harmonizing heterogeneous footprinting modalities and tying analysis choices to dataset-specific validation rather than assuming a universal pipeline.",
  "synthesis_model": "claude-haiku-5-5",
  "synthesized_on": "2026-10-31"
}
